Subject: [PATCH] media: si470x: support Si4702-C19 supply and polled tuning
Upstream-Status: Pending

Describe the receiver by part compatible and supplies, without board hooks
or board GPIO names in the protocol driver. Preserve mute/volume on open
and resume, support tuning and seek without an IRQ, and do not advertise
absent RDS. Balance supplies on shutdown and detach. Poll completion with
bounded waits, clear operation flags on every exit, and restore the old
frequency if seek fails as required by the V4L2 ABI.

---
